{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"童話主題嘉年華回歸　10座4米高木偶巡遊穿梭銅鑼灣街頭\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SC-FUN-2261115-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】藝趣嘉年華在銅鑼灣舉行，約500人參與巨型木偶巡遊。</p><p>沿途由裝扮成童話角色的舞蹈員以及學生開路，巡遊隊伍在維多利亞公園出發，途經記利佐治街及崇光百貨至東角道折返。</p><p>嘉年華以童話故事為主題，設計出10座高達4米的巨型木偶公仔，不少小朋友駐足觀賞。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.212445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:21:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T17:59:00.774568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:44.775700+00:00","content_hash":"68fce8cdf3760ed4d772b7b9c6dcb242c90897fde69b3b265a41375b0e167a60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}